# Who must approve a change. Replace the team with your own: at least two people who can each do the review, and the
# author of a change must not be the only one who can approve it.
# The workflow and this file are covered too, because a change that quietly edits the check defeats it.
/trust-root.json   @YOUR-ORG/trust-root-reviewers
/.github/          @YOUR-ORG/trust-root-reviewers
/CODEOWNERS        @YOUR-ORG/trust-root-reviewers
